---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="ALSflow — weby, software a AI asistenti pro malé firmy"
  description="Weby, software na míru a AI asistenti pro české živnostníky a malé firmy. Pevná cena řečená rovnou, rychlá odpověď, provoz zajistíme. Praha."
  canonical="https://alsflow.cz/"
  ogDescription="Tři věci, které děláme: weby, software na míru a AI asistenty. Pevná cena, rychlá odpověď."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProfessionalService",
  "name": "ALSflow",
  "legalName": "Retail Shops s.r.o.",
  "url": "https://alsflow.cz",
  "email": "info@alsflow.cz",
  "description": "Weby, software na míru a AI asistenti pro české živnostníky a malé firmy. Pevná cena, rychlá odpověď, provoz zajištěn.",
  "areaServed": [
    "CZ",
    "SK"
  ],
  "priceRange": "$$",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "Dolnoměcholupská 522/12a",
    "postalCode": "102 00",
    "addressLocality": "Praha 10",
    "addressCountry": "CZ"
  },
  "makesOffer": [
    {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "itemOffered": {
        "@type": "Service",
        "name": "Tvorba webových stránek",
        "url": "https://alsflow.cz/tvorba-webu"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "itemOffered": {
        "@type": "Service",
        "name": "Vývoj softwaru na míru",
        "url": "https://alsflow.cz/vyvoj-softwaru"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Offer",
      "itemOffered": {
        "@type": "Service",
        "name": "AI asistenti",
        "url": "https://alsflow.cz/ai-asistenti"
      }
    }
  ]
}
  </script>
  <!-- úvodní loader — zdroj a poznámky v alsflow-loader.html -->
<script>
  /* Běží co nejdřív, ještě před vykreslením obsahu — jinak by loader
     naskočil až na chvíli hotovou stránku a probliklo by to. */
  (function () {
    try {
      if (sessionStorage.getItem('als-seen')) return;
    } catch (e) {
      /* privátní okno nebo zakázané úložiště — loader prostě ukážeme */
    }
    document.documentElement.classList.add('als-loading');
  })();
</script>
  </Fragment>
  <div class="sheet" id="sheet">
    <a href="/tvorba-webu">Weby</a>
    <a href="/vyvoj-softwaru">Software na m&iacute;ru</a>
    <a href="/ai-asistenti">AI asistenti</a>
    <a href="/cenik">Cen&iacute;k</a>
    <a href="/o-nas">O n&aacute;s</a>
    <a href="/kontakt">Kontakt</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/kontakt">Nez&aacute;vazn&aacute; nab&iacute;dka</a>
  </div>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-stage">
      <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"><i class="a1"></i><i class="a2"></i></div>
      <canvas id="arc3d" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <canvas id="arcCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Praha &middot; voln&aacute; kapacita</span>
        <h1 class="h-hero fade-head reveal-words" style="margin-top:1.6rem">Weby, software<br />a <span class="grad">AI asistenti</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">Jeden &ccaron;lov&ecaron;k, t&rcaron;i &rcaron;emesla a pevn&aacute; cena &rcaron;e&ccaron;en&aacute; rovnou. Stav&iacute;me pro &zcaron;ivnostn&iacute;ky a mal&eacute; firmy, kter&eacute; nechtěj&iacute; &rcaron;e&scaron;it techniku ani &ccaron;ekat t&yacute;den na odpov&ecaron;&dcaron;.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-grad btn-shine" href="/kontakt">Nez&aacute;vazn&aacute; nab&iacute;dka</a>
          <a class="btn btn-magnet" href="#co-delame">Co d&ecaron;l&aacute;me <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="facts">
          <span class="fact">Odpov&iacute;m do <b>48 hodin</b> v pracovn&iacute; dny</span>
          <span class="fact">Web od <b><span class="todo">doplnit</span></b></span>
          <span class="fact">Pevn&aacute; cena, <b>ne hodinovka</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="stats-sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat-band">
        <div class="stat-cell rev">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count="3">3</span>
          <span class="stat-label">&rcaron;emesla pod jednou st&rcaron;echou &mdash; web, software, AI asistent</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-cell rev" data-d="1">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count="5">5</span>
          <span class="stat-label">pracovn&iacute;ch dn&uring;, ne&zcaron; asistent poprv&eacute; odpov&iacute; za v&aacute;s</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-cell rev" data-d="2">
          <span class="stat-num" data-count="0">0</span>
          <span class="stat-label">cookies, souhlas&uring; a n&aacute;stroj&uring; t&rcaron;et&iacute;ch stran na na&scaron;ich webech</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec-line" id="co-delame">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow-label">Co d&ecaron;l&aacute;me</span>
        <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">T&rcaron;i v&ecaron;ci. V&scaron;echny <span class="grad">po&rcaron;&aacute;dn&ecaron;</span>.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Ka&zcaron;d&aacute; m&aacute; vlastn&iacute; str&aacute;nku s postupem, cenou a uk&aacute;zkami toho, co u&zcaron; b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute;.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-3">
        <a class="panel panel-glow panel-sheen tilt rev " href="/tvorba-webu">
          <div class="panel-pad">
            <span class="tile" style="width:auto"><span class="box" style="margin:0 0 1.3rem"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="4.5" width="19" height="15" rx="2"/><path d="M2.5 9h19"/><path d="M6 12.5h7M6 15.5h4.5"/></svg></span></span>
            <h3 class="h-sub" style="margin-bottom:0.6rem">Weby</h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.4rem">Ru&ccaron;n&ecaron; psan&yacute; web bez redak&ccaron;n&iacute;ho syst&eacute;mu a bez plugin&uring;, kter&eacute; je pot&rcaron;eba aktualizovat. N&aacute;vrh, texty, nasazen&iacute;, dom&eacute;na i pr&uring;b&ecaron;&zcaron;n&aacute; spr&aacute;va.</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Od <span class="todo">doplnit</span> K&ccaron; &middot; spr&aacute;va <span class="todo">doplnit</span> K&ccaron;/m&ecaron;s</p>
            <span class="btn-quiet" style="padding-left:0">Zjistit v&iacute;c <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="panel panel-glow panel-sheen tilt rev " href="/vyvoj-softwaru">
          <div class="panel-pad">
            <span class="tile" style="width:auto"><span class="box" style="margin:0 0 1.3rem"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="19" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M9 3.5v17M2.5 8h19"/><path d="M12 12h6.5M12 15.5h6.5"/></svg></span></span>
            <h3 class="h-sub" style="margin-bottom:0.6rem">Software na m&iacute;ru</h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.4rem">Administra&ccaron;n&iacute; panely, napojen&iacute; syst&eacute;m&uring;, kter&eacute; spolu nemluv&iacute;, a intern&iacute; n&aacute;stroje m&iacute;sto tabulek. Nasazen&iacute; v &rcaron;&aacute;du t&yacute;dn&uring;.</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Od <span class="todo">doplnit</span> K&ccaron; &middot; pevn&yacute; rozsah</p>
            <span class="btn-quiet" style="padding-left:0">Zjistit v&iacute;c <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a class="panel panel-glow panel-sheen tilt rev " href="/ai-asistenti">
          <div class="panel-pad">
            <span class="tile" style="width:auto"><span class="box" style="margin:0 0 1.3rem"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 6.5A2 2 0 0 1 5.5 4.5h13a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H10l-4.5 3.2V16.5h-.5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><path d="M8 9.5v3M11.5 8v6M15 9v4M18 10.5v1"/></svg></span></span>
            <h3 class="h-sub" style="margin-bottom:0.6rem">AI asistenti</h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.4rem">AI odpov&iacute;d&aacute; z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k&uring;m, objedn&aacute;v&aacute; term&iacute;ny a p&rcaron;ipom&iacute;n&aacute; je. B&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute; na WhatsAppu, e-mailu a webu, kter&eacute; u&zcaron; m&aacute;te.</p>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--t2);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Od <b style="color:var(--t1)">2&nbsp;500 K&ccaron;</b>/m&ecaron;s &middot; bez z&aacute;vazk&uring;</p>
            <span class="btn-quiet" style="padding-left:0">Zjistit v&iacute;c <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row rev" data-d="2" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-swap" href="/cenik"><span class="lbl"><span>Cel&yacute; cen&iacute;k</span><span>Cel&yacute; cen&iacute;k</span></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="sec sec-line" id="zive">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow-label">&Zcaron;iv&ecaron;</span>
          <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k p&iacute;&scaron;e. <span class="grad">Asistent odpov&iacute;d&aacute;.</span></h2>
          <p class="lead">Ptaj&iacute; se po&rcaron;&aacute;d na to sam&eacute; &mdash; kdy m&aacute;te volno, kolik to stoj&iacute;, kde se d&aacute; zaparkovat. Asistent odpov&iacute;d&aacute; va&scaron;&iacute;m t&oacute;nem a z va&scaron;ich podklad&uring;, term&iacute;n zap&iacute;&scaron;e do kalend&aacute;&rcaron;e a den p&rcaron;edem ho p&rcaron;ipomene.</p>
          <ul class="list" style="margin-top:2.1rem">
            <li><strong>Odpov&iacute;d&aacute; i v deset ve&ccaron;er.</strong> Kdy&zcaron; m&aacute;te ruce v pr&aacute;ci, z&aacute;kazn&iacute;k ne&ccaron;ek&aacute; do r&aacute;na.</li>
            <li><strong>B&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute; tam, kde u&zcaron; jste.</strong> WhatsApp, e-mail i chat na webu, kter&yacute; m&aacute;te.</li>
            <li><strong>Nevym&yacute;&scaron;l&iacute; si.</strong> Kdy&zcaron; si nev&iacute; rady, po&scaron;le dotaz rovnou v&aacute;m.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row">
            <a class="btn btn-fill" href="/ai-asistenti">Jak asistent funguje <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8h9M8.5 4.5 12 8l-3.5 3.5"/></svg></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-demo panel-ring rev-pop" data-d="1">
          <div class="chat-top">
            <span class="av">AI</span>
            <div>
              <div class="who">Asistent kade&rcaron;nictv&iacute;</div>
              <div class="live">odpov&iacute;d&aacute; obvykle do minuty</div>
            </div>
            <span class="ai-badge">AI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chat-body">
            <div class="chat-row me"><span class="msg">Dobr&yacute; den, m&aacute;te volno v p&aacute;tek odpoledne?</span></div>
            <div class="chat-row bot"><span class="msg">Dobr&yacute; den! V p&aacute;tek je volno ve 14:30 a v 16:00. Kter&yacute; term&iacute;n v&aacute;m sed&iacute; l&iacute;p?</span></div>
            <div class="chat-row me"><span class="msg">To v 16:00, pros&iacute;m.</span></div>
            <div class="chat-row bot"><span class="msg">Zaps&aacute;no na p&aacute;tek 16:00. Den p&rcaron;edem po&scaron;lu p&rcaron;ipom&iacute;nku SMS.</span></div>
            <div class="chat-row bot"><span class="msg"><span class="typing" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="vh">Asistent p&iacute;&scaron;e dal&scaron;&iacute; odpov&ecaron;&dcaron;.</span></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec-dark sec-line scene-host">
    <canvas class="scene" data-scene="halftone" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head center">
        <span class="eyebrow-label">Reference</span>
        <h2 class="h-sec fade-head reveal-words">Pro koho to <span class="grad">b&ecaron;&zcaron;&iacute;</span></h2>
        <p class="lead lead-center">T&rcaron;i klienti, kte&rcaron;í z&uring;stali. Ka&zcaron;d&yacute; za n&ecaron;co jin&eacute;ho &mdash; web, software, chatbot.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="logos rev" data-d="1">
        <a href="https://gen1.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="gen1.cz">
          <img src="/assets/ref/gen-logo-white.png" alt="GEN" width="118" height="36" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <a href="https://znalecsekelova.sk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="znalecsekelova.sk">
          <span class="mk-sek">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M3 19.5 20 6l17 13.5" /><path d="M8 21v13h24V21" /><path d="M16.5 34v-8.5h7V34" />
            </svg>
            <span><span class="n">Ing. Dagmar Sekelov&aacute;</span><br /><span class="r">Znalec</span></span>
          </span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://weloveevents.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="weloveevents.cz">
          <span class="mk-wle" aria-hidden="true"><span class="we">WE</span><span class="lo">LOVE</span><span class="cl">:</span><span class="ev">EVENTS</span></span>
          <span class="vh">WE LOVE EVENTS</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row rev" data-d="2" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-trace" href="/tvorba-webu">Podívat se na weby</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="sec-line" style="padding:3.4rem 0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow-label" style="text-align:center">Postaven&eacute; na n&aacute;stroj&iacute;ch, kter&eacute; zn&aacute;te</span>
      <div class="marquee rev">
